      "value": "@{5a9e08c06c994d2a9d43e25a|full_name}, Most models today go around between 200k to 600k polys, cause 70k is seen as impossible by the majority of people, it makes the system useless since the other limits are actually reasonable. What Frajs is sugesting is that if we increase the ammount of polys per rank more people will try to conform instead of completely ignoring it like we all do right now :)",
